'''Tentacool''' (Japanese: '''メノクラゲ''' ''Menokurage'') is a {{ct|Water}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Secluded Springs}} expansion.

