==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Aquapolis|Tentacool|113}} from the {{TCG|Aquapolis}} expansion; both cards feature the Poison Sting attack.
*{{m|Poison Sting}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Tentacool}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

